      "taskMessage": "<b>Aisha:</b> Compare the request-and-reply pairs in this ARGUS-LABNET edge-capture excerpt (14:03 UTC):<br><b>14:03:01</b> 198.51.100.42 → 10.40.8.11 ICMP Echo Request; 10.40.8.11 → 198.51.100.42 ICMP Echo Reply<br><b>14:03:02</b> 198.51.100.42 → 10.40.8.12 ICMP Echo Request; 10.40.8.12 → 198.51.100.42 ICMP Echo Reply<br><b>14:03:03</b> 198.51.100.42 → 10.40.8.13 ICMP Echo Request; 10.40.8.13 → 198.51.100.42 ICMP Echo Reply",
